cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, data or hardware design, please cite the article below."
title: "ZebrafishMotion: analysis code, trained networks and open hardware for nonlinear characterisation of zebrafish locomotion"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline, DeepLabCut networks (ZebrafishNet and MultiZebrafishNet),
  pose estimates and open-hardware designs supporting the study of latent
  motion features in scoliotic zebrafish.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/xavierMarimon/ZebrafishMotion"
keywords:
  - zebrafish
  - scoliosis
  - nonlinear time series analysis
  - surrogate data testing
  - permutation entropy
  - DeepLabCut
  - open hardware
